					"lines": [
						3
					],
					"text": "All four arms render «Установить все {count}», treating agents as inanimate and inconsistent with action.all_builtins («всех встроенных агентов»). Reproduced at 1/2/5/21.",
					"recommendation": "Use «Установить всех {count}» consistently with the adjacent full agent label, or a count-neutral button with the count in parentheses.",
					"disposition": "open, non-blocking"
				},
				{
					"id": "RU-M5",
					"severity": "minor",
					"key": "ui.agents.starters.summary.collisions",
					"file": "src/i18n/catalogues/ru/ui.agents.starters.json",
					"lines": [
						11
					],
					"text": "Russian one also matches 21/101, not only 1. At 21 the current arm says «у вас уже есть агент с именем {names}» although multiple agents/names collided. The skipped count and all placeholders remain visible; this is non-blocking grammar, not a lost-count defect.",
					"recommendation": "Use an =1 arm for the truly singular explanation and a plural/count-neutral explanation for counts such as 21, retaining {count} and {names} in every arm.",
					"disposition": "open, non-blocking"
				}
			]
		},
